sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant FuseJS as Fuse.js
    participant LocalStorage
    participant Plausible

    Note over Browser: Page Load
    Browser->>FuseJS: fetch(/static/search-index.json)
    FuseJS-->>Browser: search index loaded

    Note over User,Browser: User Interaction
    User->>Browser: Type query
    Browser->>Browser: Debounce 200ms
    Browser->>LocalStorage: save recent query
    Browser->>FuseJS: search(query)
    FuseJS-->>Browser: ranked results
    Browser->>Browser: apply facet filters
    Browser->>Browser: apply concept boost
    Browser->>Browser: update URL params (?q=&f_pillar=)
    Browser->>User: render result cards

    Note over User,Plausible: Analytics
    Browser->>Plausible: plausible('search', {query, results, filters})

    User->>Browser: click result
    Browser->>Plausible: plausible('search_result_click', {query, slug, position})
    Browser->>User: navigate to result page
